      "proposed_content": "The bound parents do not establish one exact 1/log T threshold across all three representations: the matrix transition is organized by N|alpha|, the lower-bound contour groups poles at distance O(1/log T), but the prime-sum lemma changes behavior at |a| comparable to 1/log z.",
